 intricate architectural details. High ceilings enhance the open and airy ambiance across the expansive main living areas. The home is ideal for both grand-scale entertaining and peaceful retreat, offering dual gourmet kitchens (Western and Chinese), a wet bar, sauna, gym space, meditation room, and a serene courtyard featuring a beautiful elephant fountain. Five of the seven bedrooms are en-suite and thoughtfully distributed across two levels, offering comfort and privacy for all. A flexible 928-square-foot loft space adds further versatility - ideal as a home office, media room, or creative studio. The 3-car garage ensures ample space for parking and storage. \"The Country\" community emphasizes privacy, luxury, and security, with 24-hour guarded access, regular security patrols, and resort-style amenities including hiking and equestrian trails, a heated pool, tennis courts, and a clubhouse. This is more than a home - it's a rare opportunity to live in a work of art, thoughtfully crafted and infused with elegance at every turn.", "remarksLength": 1765, "listedBy": "Yen Wu", "propertyTypeName": "Single Family Residential", "totalSqft": 6732, "history": [{"date": "2026-06-19", "event": "Listed", "price": 4980000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-06-18", "event": "Listing Removed", "price": null, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-02-02", "event": "Price Changed", "price": 4998000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2024-10-06", "event": "Listed", "price": 5280000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2003-02-28", "event": "Listing Removed", "price": null, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2003-01-30", "event": "Sold (MLS)", "price": 1300000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2003-01-30", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 1300000, "source": "Public Records"}, {"date": "2002-12-31", "event": "Listing Removed", "price": null, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2002-11-19", "event": "Listed", "price": 1280000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2001-12-06", "event": "Listed", "price": 128